WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:07.115
Car and van dealers, welcome to The Motoring Central. This is how it works, and what's in it for you.

00:00:07.915 --> 00:00:19.382
Listing a car takes minutes. Type the registration, and the details fill in for you. Add your photos and your price, or bring in your whole stock from a spreadsheet, or from a stock feed that updates every night.

00:00:20.182 --> 00:00:33.809
Buyers search by make, price, mileage and more. Every advert shows the car's full MOT history from the DVSA, with the mileage at each test, and cars that have passed a history check are marked, so buyers can trust what they see.

00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:41.744
Buyers message you directly, and every enquiry is saved for you as a lead. And we never take commission on the cars you sell.

00:00:42.544 --> 00:00:52.747
Your dashboard is more than adverts. There's a stock book, with your costs and your profit on every car, and there are sales invoices, with deposits and part exchange, ready to print.

00:00:53.547 --> 00:01:03.120
Got a part exchange you don't want to retail? Sell it to other dealers in our trade section, at a fixed price or open to offers, with 5 free listings every month.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:13.078
You can see how every advert is doing, with the views, the saves and the enquiries. You also get your own showroom page to share, and windscreen cards to print.

00:01:13.878 --> 00:01:26.202
Plans start at £169 plus VAT a month, depending on how many cars you list, and every plan includes vehicle history checks. Pay yearly, and you pay for 9 months and get 12.

00:01:27.002 --> 00:01:31.403
Every plan starts with 30 days free. Cancel in that time, and you pay nothing.

00:01:32.203 --> 00:01:43.161
Joining takes about five minutes. Tell us about your dealership, and upload your trade insurance, your public liability insurance and a photo ID. We check your documents, and you can start listing.

00:01:43.961 --> 00:01:50.339
Your stock, your buyers, and no commission. Join the dealer network today, at motoringcentral.co.uk.
